### all blogs (no WHERE)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs

### search lowercase
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=sql

### search uppercase — same result
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=SQL

### search mixed case
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=MicroSERVICES

### no match → empty array
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=kubernetes

### empty search → all blogs
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=

### author only
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=ong

### title only
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=micro

### author only (plural "masters" is not in any title)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=masters

### both fields, uppercase
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=LUKA

### no match
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=kubernetes